extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=53XSqZVPQWgQ7kNvwHHg63W&_nc_oc=AdobPRWfvnP7E3K_j8nbIcOBLu6yNlfozPV3QZ9Qq-VGYpJwLUMq4ps0sv_WwCCB2zs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTqalzSv-RX5MD4-T5Lkt8I6aGPFdF23rUvMYKnqNIFUA&oe=6AF487D6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N5lQdhiKf-QQ7kNvwHBLqi5&_nc_oc=Adqkc7kltQMMUq54Z60B2f7iULgeUJifdFNm7AfvynncNQO5-7QohzolIxreTFWfjbY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRgpCTBkBBw9yNTB6wppGQNvzl6Qkz99Ao1mPvupo_d9Q&oe=6AF48F22"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HbaLSbbhMqUQ7kNvwGOAfvS&_nc_oc=AdpfSnlEN4_QFDx1kTgkZ7o6oISpA2Hg3yzMfCGB9F-Kx3uX1Rb3NklIBgkcs4gFZpw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSRdnXqEuHqZYF74jRznR50tNLK47x8UdEE64vkEjj5Kg&oe=6AF49719"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":